  "bodyHash": "Yqz1MR8c5u8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1425/853/title-png.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_35387524-87cb-4c95-90f1-2ac1ca2f2cea.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">內容</h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">此附加包為Alien Evo加入了全新的變形型態——時光人（Chronosapiens）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">原型、OV、10K與UAF</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_a3a6949c-8563-408e-80c6-8df0917829ce.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_10e64346-a098-4794-9654-68137fb4c562.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">與科技氣泡融合</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_d30ae19e-4c56-4a12-87c0-2dae587074ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">獲取方式</h2><p>在主世界各處尋找<strong>馬特魯安特的時光野獸</strong>。擊敗野獸以獲得<strong>時鐘零件</strong>並製作<strong>時光人DNA</strong>來解鎖時光人。或者使用指令<code>/alienautoadd</code>。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_879bfca1-fef1-41de-848f-774822542a3b.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_cfc1f2af-e093-4197-b744-034f9a6babf2.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_14763aa3-e0db-4215-ab61-5ccf5747a70e.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_73665f29-215c-43a1-ab36-76b43b5c197e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">能力展示</h2><p>時光人並非華麗奪目的英雄，而是擁有極其複雜機制的存在。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_92ed5766-6053-4383-b893-6c30bda9f046.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_3dd4421b-4813-4622-8611-0de531b4e3fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">重要物品</h2><p>加爾文指南針：右鍵偵測礦物（冷卻4秒）。潛行右鍵則可定位全球三個馬特魯安特零件。加爾文電磁脈衝（EMP）：用於發射電磁脈衝，使範圍內生物承受更多傷害，並削弱時光人。使用全知水晶充能。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_019f19ac-67fe-4b51-96e9-5193b3c2e7c7.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bfa4ab07-8e95-423d-8b2f-2fa4b85402bd.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>時光人時間炸彈：擊敗馬特魯安特後獲得。右鍵設定程式，將目標生物從當前時間線抹除。需使用時鐘鑰匙充能。對馬特魯安特無效。可使用溯轉效應倒轉時間將其復原。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_21350384-c2f9-42ff-92b1-5137402c2ae7.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fed5b0ab-8f18-4c04-9b07-820db38ab1b5.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">最終Boss：馬特魯安特</h2><p>馬特魯安特之鑰、齒輪、六角機關、零件I與零件II：這些零件散落在主世界各地。按照順序將其放置在祭壇上以召喚馬特魯安特。外骨骼頭盔與蘇朵拉也正在尋找這些零件。當馬特魯安特爆炸時，零件與祭壇會隨機重生。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_8648003d-6566-45f2-bcd2-83c9d4a2f127.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bf91b5f8-acda-46b7-9cb7-02760c97d0a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>使用指令<code>/chrono locate</code>可定位目標，點擊座標即可傳送。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fdd55f27-5b3f-49fd-8cd4-e3465f50a027.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_97e6ec8c-5f30-4891-83cc-65cb13890c8c.png\" alt=\"image\"></p><hr>",
